{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Nighthold",
    "steam_appid": 3376960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.poster.avif?t=1754313100\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.webm?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.mp4?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a corporate starship crash, the crew is stranded on a harsh alien planet where, each night, the Rot rises from the ground \u2014 a mysterious phenomenon that destroys everything it can reach. To survive, the locals build elevated shelters known as \u2018nightholds.\u2019</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart rival human camps, fight for resources, and seize cryptic ancient technologies left behind by a lost civilization. Search for a functioning escape pod to send a distress signal, but remember \u2014 in this brutal world, survival always comes first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World, Endless Possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a fully destructible open world where every action leaves a mark. Explore dynamic environments shaped by realistic weather and fire systems \u2014 set a building ablaze, and watch it burn to the ground. Craft, cook, fish, and interact with NPCs who build their own camps and respond to your decisions. Form alliances, complete quests, or annihilate anyone who stands in your way. The world is alive, and your fate depends on how you engage with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/08746937797398dc247db01ec90b4015.poster.avif?t=1754313100\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/08746937797398dc247db01ec90b4015.webm?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/08746937797398dc247db01ec90b4015.mp4?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day, Survive by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day is your time to prepare: gather resources, craft tools and weapons, and fortify your Nighthold. But when night falls, the Rot emerges, infecting enemies, buildings, and even people around you. Defend against rotten enemies and control this mighty infection to turn the tide in your favour \u2014 or succumb to it yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/c466058eebccdf1aa97ab75b4f8e821b.poster.avif?t=1754313100\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/c466058eebccdf1aa97ab75b4f8e821b.webm?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/c466058eebccdf1aa97ab75b4f8e821b.mp4?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Together or Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive solo or team up with friends in seamless cross-platform co-op play. Work together to build, explore, and conquer the night \u2014 or face the challenges of this unforgiving world on your terms.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.poster.avif?t=1754313100\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.webm?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/0ce341d73f7fc0e6c58eacd6d5417ace.mp4?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a corporate starship crash, the crew is stranded on a harsh alien planet where, each night, the Rot rises from the ground \u2014 a mysterious phenomenon that destroys everything it can reach. To survive, the locals build elevated shelters known as \u2018nightholds.\u2019</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart rival human camps, fight for resources, and seize cryptic ancient technologies left behind by a lost civilization. Search for a functioning escape pod to send a distress signal, but remember \u2014 in this brutal world, survival always comes first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World, Endless Possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a fully destructible open world where every action leaves a mark. Explore dynamic environments shaped by realistic weather and fire systems \u2014 set a building ablaze, and watch it burn to the ground. Craft, cook, fish, and interact with NPCs who build their own camps and respond to your decisions. Form alliances, complete quests, or annihilate anyone who stands in your way. The world is alive, and your fate depends on how you engage with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/08746937797398dc247db01ec90b4015.poster.avif?t=1754313100\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/08746937797398dc247db01ec90b4015.webm?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/08746937797398dc247db01ec90b4015.mp4?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by Day, Survive by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day is your time to prepare: gather resources, craft tools and weapons, and fortify your Nighthold. But when night falls, the Rot emerges, infecting enemies, buildings, and even people around you. Defend against rotten enemies and control this mighty infection to turn the tide in your favour \u2014 or succumb to it yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/c466058eebccdf1aa97ab75b4f8e821b.poster.avif?t=1754313100\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/c466058eebccdf1aa97ab75b4f8e821b.webm?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376960/extras/c466058eebccdf1aa97ab75b4f8e821b.mp4?t=1754313100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Together or Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive solo or team up with friends in seamless cross-platform co-op play. Work together to build, explore, and conquer the night \u2014 or face the challenges of this unforgiving world on your terms.</p>",
    "short_description": "Build shelters, interact with rescuees, battle against the Rot and raiders to survive another night in this Sandbox RPG. Play Solo or team up with friends in Online \u0421o-op.",
